Note that regex.h by itself won't do anything.  You will
need the entire regex library.  The .h file just tells the
compiler some things like which functions are provided.  It
doesn't actually provide them.  (Modern languages don't need
such crutches, but C is old enough to tell Ada to get off
its lawn.)

